{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10021","headline":"古意 · 阎宽","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭树发华滋，瑶草复葳蕤。\n好鸟飞相从，愁人深此时。\n天中有灵匹，日夕嚬蛾眉。\n愿逐飘风花，千里入遥帷。\n心逝爱不见，空歌悲莫悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}